sequenceDiagram
    participant Client as 客户端
    participant Handler as WebFlux Handler
    participant Aspect as RequirePermissionAspect
    participant SecurityContext as ReactiveSecurityContextHolder
    participant UserService as UserService
    participant PermissionService as PermissionService
    participant DataScopeAspect as DataScopeAspect
    participant DataScopeProvider as ReactiveDataScopeProvider
    participant DB as MySQL (阻塞池)

    Note over Client,DB: 权限校验与数据权限流程(基于AOP切面)
    
    %% 业务请求
    Client->>+Handler: GET /admin-api/v1/users/list
    Note right of Client: Authorization: Bearer {token}
    
    Handler->>+Aspect: @RequirePermission("system:user:query")
    Note right of Handler: AOP切点拦截
    
    %% 权限校验
    Aspect->>+SecurityContext: getContext()
    SecurityContext-->>-Aspect: SecurityContext
    
    Aspect->>Aspect: context.getAuthentication()
    Note right of Aspect: 获取认证信息
    
    alt 未认证
        Aspect-->>Client: 401 UNAUTHORIZED
    end
    
    Aspect->>Aspect: authentication.getName() -> openId
    Aspect->>+UserService: getByOpenId(openId)
    UserService->>DB: SELECT * FROM sys_user WHERE open_id=?
    DB-->>UserService: User实体
    UserService-->>-Aspect: User
    
    alt 用户不存在
        Aspect-->>Client: 401 UNAUTHORIZED
    end
    
    %% 检查ROLE_ADMIN
    Aspect->>Aspect: authentication.getAuthorities()
    Aspect->>Aspect: authorities.contains("ROLE_ADMIN")
    
    opt 是管理员
        Aspect->>Handler: 直接放行
        Note right of Aspect: 管理员跳过权限检查
    end
    
    %% 普通用户权限查询
    Aspect->>+PermissionService: getPermissionsByUserId(userId)
    PermissionService->>DB: 查询用户角色和权限
    Note right of DB: SELECT p.code FROM sys_permission p<br/>JOIN sys_role_permission rp ON p.id = rp.permission_id<br/>JOIN sys_user_role ur ON rp.role_id = ur.role_id<br/>WHERE ur.user_id = ?
    DB-->>PermissionService: 权限列表
    PermissionService-->>-Aspect: Set<String> permissions
    
    %% 权限匹配
    Aspect->>Aspect: checkPermission(permissions, required, logical)
    Note right of Aspect: Logical.AND: 全部满足<br/>Logical.OR: 任一满足
    
    alt 权限不足
        Aspect-->>Client: 403 FORBIDDEN
    end
    
    Aspect->>Handler: 权限校验通过
    Note right of Aspect: 继续执行业务方法
    
    %% 数据权限(可选)
    opt 方法标注@DataScope
        Handler->>+DataScopeAspect: @DataScope(type=DEPT)
        DataScopeAspect->>+DataScopeProvider: resolve()
        DataScopeProvider->>SecurityContext: 获取当前用户
        DataScopeProvider->>DB: 查询用户数据权限
        Note right of DB: 根据角色查询<br/>data_scope配置
        DB-->>DataScopeProvider: DataScopeInfo
        DataScopeProvider-->>-DataScopeAspect: DataScopeInfo
        
        alt 无法解析数据权限
            DataScopeAspect-->>Client: 500 IllegalStateException
            Note right of DataScopeAspect: 数据权限解析失败抛异常
        end
        
        DataScopeAspect->>DataScopeAspect: 构建DataScopeContext.Scope
        DataScopeAspect->>Handler: contextWrite(Reactor Context)
        Note right of DataScopeAspect: 通过Reactor Context<br/>传递数据权限上下文
    end
    
    %% 执行业务查询
    Handler->>DB: 执行查询
    Note right of DB: MyBatis-Plus拦截器注入WHERE条件<br/>FROM DataScopeContext
    
    alt type=ALL
        Note right of DB: 无过滤
    else type=DEPT
        Note right of DB: AND dept_id = {userDeptId}
    else type=DEPT_AND_CHILD
        Note right of DB: AND dept_id IN (userDeptId及子部门)
    else type=CUSTOM
        Note right of DB: AND {customSql}
    end
    
    DB-->>Handler: 过滤后的数据
    Handler-->>-Client: 200 OK {filteredData}
    
    Note over Client,DB: 权限拒绝时不返回数据,解析失败时抛出异常
